      "writtenOn": "2022-08-22T18:53:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am worried that the direct interface to set connectability gets \"abused\" since it\u0027s too convenient. Let\u0027s make this as private as possible for now, and if a need arises in the future to make this public, we can expose it but probably we want to change the design a bit so to make it safer, e.g. like `register_connectable_session(\u0026self, callback: ...)` that can also detect client disconnection/crash so that the connectability state doesn\u0027t get stuck.",
